    <briefdescription>
<para>&lt;+description of block+&gt; </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This block collects a certain number of samples over each of the input streams and forms a (number of inputs x snap shot size) matrix. Then, it produces a correlation matrix of size (number of inputs x number of inputs) using either Forward Averaging method or Forward-Backward Averaging method. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
